            "type": "game",
            "name": "Ravenfield",
            "steam_appid": 636480,
            "required_age": "14",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by sandbox shooters of the past, Ravenfield picks up the torch of team-vs-team war games with a twist: everyone but you is a computer controlled player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your experience with tens of thousands of community-made mods, ranging from weapons to vehicles and story missions! Feeling creative? Try your hand at creating your own scenarios using our extensive mod tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as infantry, in armored vehicles, watercraft, or in aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active ragdoll physics combines tactical strategies with a sprinkle of silly fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own scenarios by combining weapons, vehicles and skins with the maps you wish to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete modding freedom, ranging from weapons and maps to levels and campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of combatants is only limited by what your computer can handle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODDING FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravenfield features rich modding support designed to allow anyone to try their hand at game content creation, and to share them with friends and strangers via Steam Workshop. The modding system currently supports these features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom maps using the mod tools or the map editor built into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom Weapons, Vehicles and Skins to build your own faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully featured scripting API is available for  Lua.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up story missions using Lua or by visual scripting through our own Trigger system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for Custom game modes is coming soon!</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by sandbox shooters of the past, Ravenfield picks up the torch of team-vs-team war games with a twist: everyone but you is a computer controlled player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your experience with tens of thousands of community-made mods, ranging from weapons to vehicles and story missions! Feeling creative? Try your hand at creating your own scenarios using our extensive mod tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as infantry, in armored vehicles, watercraft, or in aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active ragdoll physics combines tactical strategies with a sprinkle of silly fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own scenarios by combining weapons, vehicles and skins with the maps you wish to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete modding freedom, ranging from weapons and maps to levels and campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of combatants is only limited by what your computer can handle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODDING FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ravenfield features rich modding support designed to allow anyone to try their hand at game content creation, and to share them with friends and strangers via Steam Workshop. The modding system currently supports these features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom maps using the mod tools or the map editor built into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom Weapons, Vehicles and Skins to build your own faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully featured scripting API is available for  Lua.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up story missions using Lua or by visual scripting through our own Trigger system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for Custom game modes is coming soon!</p></li></ul>",
